# Secrets
.env
__pycache__/

# Downloaded dataset slices. Not committed: they are civil_comments content,
# and step 1 is seeded (SEED = 7), so `python3 1_get_data.py` reproduces the
# exact same natural.csv and hard.csv byte for byte.
data/

# results/ IS committed on purpose. The charts and summary tables are the
# point of the repo, the README embeds one of them, and the raw JSONL lets
# anyone re-derive every number without an API key or spending anything.
# Total is ~2MB once the simulated files below are excluded.

# Simulated output is fake data for testing the plumbing. Committing it would
# put invented numbers in the repo next to real ones.
results/*SIMULATED*
POST.md
POST_v2.md
__pycache__/
*.pyc
